cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "PBPK-ML: graph-based molecular embeddings for hybrid ML-PBPK modeling"
abstract: >-
  Code, trained encoders, data and analysis for a study combining graph attention (AttentiveFP)
  molecular embeddings with RDKit descriptors to predict human fraction unbound, systemic clearance
  and steady-state volume of distribution, and for the evaluation of those predictions as inputs to
  physiologically based pharmacokinetic simulations in Simcyp.
type: software
